<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>📥 Tu PDF: 3 Casos Prácticos de IA para Contadores</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>Aquí está tu PDF con los recursos que solicitaste</mj-preview>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text font-size="16px" color="#ffffff" line-height="170%" />
      <mj-section padding="0" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      .link { color: #a855f7; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; }
      .link:hover { color: #9333ea; text-decoration: underline; }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#000000">

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <mj-section background-color="#0f0518" padding="48px 20px 32px">
      <mj-column>
        <!-- Greeting -->
        <mj-text
          color="#ffffff"
          font-size="18px"
          font-weight="600"
          padding-bottom="24px"
        >
          Hola [Name,fallback=Contador/a] 👋
        </mj-text>

        <!-- Introduction -->
        <mj-text padding-bottom="24px">
          Aquí está tu PDF con los recursos que solicitaste:
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- PDF Cover Section -->
    <mj-section background-color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)" padding="32px 20px 24px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image
          src="https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/todoconta.com/uploads/Casos+pra%CC%81cticos_+3+flujos+hi%CC%81bridos+que+te+ahorrara%CC%81n+horas.png"
          border-radius="8px"
          padding-bottom="0"
          alt="Portada: Casos prácticos - 3 flujos híbridos que te ahorrarán horas"
        />
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Download Button Section -->
    <mj-section background-color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)" padding="0px 20px 40px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-button
          background-color="#a855f7"
          color="#ffffff"
          font-size="18px"
          font-weight="700"
          border-radius="8px"
          href="https://s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/todoconta.com/uploads/Casos+pra%CC%81cticos_+3+flujos+hi%CC%81bridos+que+te+ahorrara%CC%81n+horas.pdf"
          padding="0 0 0 0"
          inner-padding="16px 48px"
        >
          📥 Descargar PDF Ahora
        </mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- PDF Contents Section -->
    <mj-section background-color="#0f0518" padding="32px 20px 24px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text
          color="#ffffff"
          font-size="20px"
          font-weight="700"
          padding-bottom="20px"
        >
          Dentro encontrarás:
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text color="#eab308" padding-bottom="8px">
          ✓ Caso 2: Revisión CFDI Masiva (5h → 15 min)
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#eab308" padding-bottom="8px">
          ✓ Caso 3: Respuesta a Requerimiento SAT (2h → 10 min)
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#eab308" padding-bottom="8px">
          ✓ 10 plantillas de prompts listas para copiar/pegar
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text color="#eab308" padding-bottom="0px">
          ✓ Matriz de decisión completa
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Quick Tip Section -->
    <mj-section background-color="rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.1)" padding="32px 20px" border="2px solid #a855f7" border-radius="8px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text
          color="#a855f7"
          font-size="18px"
          font-weight="700"
          padding-bottom="12px"
        >
          💡 Tip rápido
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text
          color="#ffffff"
          padding-bottom="0px"
        >
          Empieza por el Caso 2 si tienes clientes con muchas facturas por revisar. Es el que más tiempo ahorra.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Video Section -->
    <mj-section background-color="#0f0518" padding="40px 20px 16px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-style="dashed" border-color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)" padding-bottom="32px" />

        <mj-text
          color="#ffffff"
          font-size="18px"
          font-weight="600"
          padding-bottom="16px"
        >
          PD: ¿Viste el video del Caso 1 (Arquitecto López)?
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text
          color="#9ca3af"
          padding-bottom="24px"
        >
          Si no, aquí está:
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Video Thumbnail Section -->
    <mj-section background-color="rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05)" padding="32px 20px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image
          src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/fokb3vN5jaQ/maxresdefault.jpg"
          href="https://youtu.be/fokb3vN5jaQ"
          border-radius="8px"
          padding-bottom="24px"
          alt="Ver Video del Caso 1: Arquitecto López"
        />

        <mj-button
          background-color="#eab308"
          color="#000000"
          font-size="16px"
          font-weight="700"
          border-radius="8px"
          href="https://youtu.be/fokb3vN5jaQ"
          padding="0 0 0 0"
          inner-padding="14px 40px"
        >
          ▶️ Ver Video del Caso 1
        </mj-button>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <!-- Signature -->
    <mj-section background-color="#0f0518" padding="40px 20px 32px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text
          color="#ffffff"
          font-size="18px"
          padding-bottom="24px"
        >
          Saludos,
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text
          color="#ffffff"
          font-weight="600"
          padding-bottom="8px"
        >
          Israel Castro <br /> <span style="color: #9ca3af; font-weight: 400;">TodoConta</span>
        </mj-text>

        <mj-text
          color="#6b7280"
          font-size="12px"
          align="center"
          padding-top="32px"
          padding-bottom="8px"
        >
          <a href="[unsubscribe]" style="color: #6b7280; text-decoration: underline;">Cancelar suscripción</a>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
